    "title": "Cleaner Goal",
    "description": "Cleaner Goal is a free, secure tool that helps you find files faster, manage files easily, and delete junk files.\r\n\r\nMain functions:\r\n\r\n\u2763\ufe0fEasily browse all images, tools, videos, music, documents, and applications, which will be automatically categorized.\r\n\r\n\u2728Swiftly move, delete, open and share files, as well as rename and copy-paste.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25Effortlessly see and manage all applications installed on your local device.\r\n\r\n\u231bEfficiently view your storage stats and manage all folders on your device.\r\n\r\n\u270dThoroughly scan the temporary files and residual data in the mobile phone, and clear it with one click.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf2Quickly clear the clutter notification, keep the notification bar neat.\r\n\r\nIf you are looking for an efficient app that has simple and sleek interface with full features, Cleaner Goal would be a good choice.",
